        "## 8. Variance Inflation Factor (VIF) & Prediction for a New Example\n",
        "We compute VIF for each predictor on the training set to formally assess multicollinearity, and predict `Sales` for a new campaign budget within the training data range (`TV=$150k`, `Radio=$25k`, `Newspaper=$20k`)."
      ],
